Node ID=01 Conversation Start
Text=Ah, so the portals have brought another visitor. Such a devious trap - and one few can resist, it seems. The price of your intrusion into my private plane is imprisonment on this island - for however long you can last. But I suspect my undead servants shall dispose of you soon enough.
