Node ID=43 Barter 2
Text=Eh? *More* spirits? What is this nonsense you speak of?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I am from the far south, and my people carry a strange binding enchantment to each other...as long as I live, they will know and search for me, leading them here. If I die, however, they will give up the search. <Lie>
Go to node ID=45 Barter 3

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I am a heretic, and have committed crimes against the Inquisition. As long as their divinations determine I am alive, they will send their agents after me...even to here.
